   "description": "For this project I plugged into Yahoo Finance’s API in python, and made a simple graphical interface that scrolled through a custom list of stocks while showing the sparkline and historical data and performance. This program was plugged into an ESP32 microcontroller with MicroPython and a simple I2C OLED screen.",
