   "takeaway": "This was a really fun project because now that I am done I have this little desktop device that shows stocks that I can use. This was also a good way to start to understand how wiring for screens and other peripherals works for small devices like microcontrollers. Hopefully I can use what I learned in this project to make more commercial-ready hardware...",
