   "description": "For this project, I designed a short 4 level game that simulates the driving sections of the classic American novel: The Great Gatsby. I made this game within the span of a couple days, and it was the first time I really used the pseudo class system in Pico-8’s Lua. This game was made for an english final, and was the first time that I publicly shared a program I created. Play the game <a href=\"demos.html#gatsby-game\">here</a>.",
