   "description": "For this project, I used a CNC to make a custom engraving on a plastic yo-yo. One side is engraved with my initials, while the other side is my own custom smiley face design. I used handwritten G Code to program the movements of the CNC machine. I then spray painted the yo-yo to emphasize the engraving.",
