   "takeaway": "Although I made a small mistake in my G code that led to a slightly deeper engraving than expected, I still learned a lot about the power of subtractive manufacturing. Although I don’t use many metal pieces, I would be interested in possibly creating metal parts via the CNC for future engineering projects…",
